# projects saved before the eras (format 3: AMB-1 0.9 before the layer pages; format 4: AMB-1 1.x and this fork's
# first rounds) load safely: the pieces in their slots are other pieces now, so each takes the eras' recipe, and only
# the player's own settings carry over: Tune, MIDI out, the lights, the piece that was playing
wait 300
tap GLO
spin K2 7
expect par16 7
turn PRESET 4
expect piece 4
storev3 33
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 4
expect par16 7
# Glass Choir's recipe, not the old project's Pad of 33
expect par0 62
expect par22 3
expect par28 30
expect par32 4
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 62
expect par16 7
# format 4 (28 settings a piece): the same
turn PRESET 2
expect piece 6
storev4 21
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 6
expect par16 7
expect par0 38
expect par7 7
expect par30 55
# and the slots still remember: a tweak on the migrated project, saved
tap ENV
spin K1 2
expect par0 40
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 40
